1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,562
Protein siapa

2
00:00:00,562 --> 00:00:01,551
yang lebih tinggi?

3
00:00:01,551 --> 00:00:02,417
Tempe...

4
00:00:02,417 --> 00:00:03,095
atau telur?

5
00:00:04,305 --> 00:00:05,470
Jawabannya...

6
00:00:05,470 --> 00:00:06,166
TEMPE!

7
00:00:06,166 --> 00:00:06,951
Per seratus gram,

8
00:00:06,951 --> 00:00:08,398
tempe dua puluh gram protein,

9
00:00:08,398 --> 00:00:09,970
telur cuma dua belas!

10
00:00:09,970 --> 00:00:12,735
Tapi awas, ada jebakan angka...

11
00:00:12,735 --> 00:00:13,882
di akhir video.

12
00:00:13,882 --> 00:00:15,163
Rahasianya?

13
00:00:15,163 --> 00:00:15,904
Kedelai,

14
00:00:15,904 --> 00:00:17,387
kacang yang kaya protein.

15
00:00:17,387 --> 00:00:18,869
Lalu difermentasi

16
00:00:18,869 --> 00:00:20,887
jamur Rhizopus...

17
00:00:20,887 --> 00:00:22,241
jadi lebih gampang dicerna!

18
00:00:22,241 --> 00:00:23,633
Nah, ini jebakannya:

19
00:00:23,633 --> 00:00:25,964
angka tadi per seratus gram.

20
00:00:25,964 --> 00:00:28,678
Sebutir telur: tujuh koma enam gram.

21
00:00:28,678 --> 00:00:30,053
Sepotong tempe tipis:

22
00:00:30,053 --> 00:00:32,348
cuma lima koma satu gram!

23
00:00:32,348 --> 00:00:33,585
Jadi...

24
00:00:33,585 --> 00:00:35,824
makan tempenya dua potong!

25
00:00:35,824 --> 00:00:37,999
Tempe: murah, asli Indonesia,

26
00:00:37,999 --> 00:00:40,418
tercatat sejak tahun seribu delapan ratusan!

27
00:00:40,418 --> 00:00:41,131
Kirim ke temanmu

28
00:00:41,131 --> 00:00:43,811
yang suka meremehkan tempe!

